discovered_tools.description:
Return metadata for an explicitly selected vault id. This tool is part of plugin `LLM Wiki`.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__llm_wiki__wiki_get_vault(args: {
  // id returned by wiki_select_vault
  vault_id: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult<{ layout: string; root: string; timezone: string; vault_id: string; }>>; };
```

Explicitly associate a project directory with a vault. This tool is part of plugin `LLM Wiki`.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__llm_wiki__wiki_select_vault(args: {
  // explicit wiki or obsidian style; absent preserves selection
  layout?: string;
  // absolute project directory
  project_path: string;
  // optional IANA timezone selected for this vault
  timezone?: string;
  // absolute vault directory
  vault_path: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult<{ layout: string; root: string; timezone: string; vault_id: string; }>>; };
```
